  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1374/962/swashbucklersbanner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2087\" height=\"732\"></p><p><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;text-align:center\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoftware.halbear.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1374/963/halbear-netbanner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1620\" height=\"328\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fhalstudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/663/646/bisecthosting.png\" alt=\"bisecthosting\" width=\"1126\" height=\"313\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">&nbsp;*請注意：柯維特蒸汽船仍在開發中，可於1.18及以上版本使用指令「/summon hpm:corvette_steamship」召喚，且可能不會向下移植。</span></h3><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Swashbucklers 是一個海盜船模組！</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">目前包含6艘船，以及一件武器！</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">Discord 以獲取最新更新與公告：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/UqtarNpnQJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/UqtarNpnQJ</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z_F8-aWiY9I\" width=\"638\" height=\"538\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zr9vKc_tojk\" width=\"631\" height=\"370\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rNsuVnI0LXU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/126/swashbuckler-swashbucklers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"443\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/127/upgraded-swashbuckler-swashbucklers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"597\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/128/raft-swashbucklers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"597\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/129/cutter-swashbucklers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"597\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/130/war-cutter-swashbucklers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"597\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/131/corvette-steamship-swashbucklers.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"597\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span>其他特色包括：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">-手砲</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/344/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"362\" height=\"253\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">-當第一階段損毀或被破壞時，帆船會進入受損階段</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/563/930/2022-12-20_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"517\" height=\"267\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">-升級版的海盜船配有火炮，當你的物品欄中有炮彈時，按下H鍵即可發射</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/563/932/swashbucklerupgradedsideview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"434\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;合成配方：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">*炮彈每次合成16個</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/563/759/recipes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"691\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;部分圖片：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/563/769/2022-12-20_00.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/563/770/2022-12-19_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"581\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/567/78/2022-12-21_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"581\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/563/931/2022-12-19_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"581\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/567/103/2022-12-21_01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/572/810/2022-12-21_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Swashbucklers 長期發展：</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">開發路線圖：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftrello.com%252fb%252fhOr7bznZ%252fswashbucklers\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://trello.com/b/hOr7bznZ/swashbucklers</a></span></span></p>",
